# /meta-status — Meta-Evolution Dashboard

Show the current state of the AEVO-style meta-evolution system.

## Instructions

Run the meta-evolution orchestrator in status mode:

```bash
D:/code/invesments/master_investments/.claude/skills/.venv/Scripts/python.exe \
  D:/code/invesments/master_investments/.claude/lib/intelligence/mechanism/meta_evolution_orchestrator.py \
  --mode status
```

Parse the JSON output and present as a formatted dashboard:

## Dashboard Format

### Controller State
- Status: IDLE | SEGMENT_RUNNING
- Outcomes since last edit: N (trigger at 5)
- Active segment: {id} ({collected}/{needed} verdicts) or "none"

### Last Meta-Edit
- Knob: {knob_id}
- Change: {old_value} → {new_value}
- Reason: {reason}
- Result: KEPT | REVERTED | AMPLIFIED | pending

### Error Attribution Summary
- Total mechanism errors attributed
- Top culprit knobs (sorted by error count)
- Next meta-edit trigger: N more outcomes needed

### Safety Status
- Weekly budget: {used}/3 edits
- Invariant violations: {count}
- Auto-rollbacks: {count}

### Current Knob Values
Run `KnobRegistry.snapshot_markdown()` to show all 23 knobs with current values.

If any component fails, show partial results with warning.
